      "general": {
        "abstract": "\"Chornohirskiy geographical station\" (CHGS) by Ivan Franko National University of Lviv (LNU) is located at the upper part of the Prut river basin, at 17 km from the town Vorokhta, Ivano-Frankivsk region and is within Carpathian National Nature Park (48˚10̍ .45 N; 24˚34̍.32 E). The station was founded in 1978 and is in operation by now.",
